</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">MMLU (5-shot) results and latency for selected llama3.2 configurations. Accuracy is reported in %, latency in seconds.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
