</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S5.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">ARC-Challenge results and latency for selected llama3.2 configurations. Accuracy is reported in %, latency in seconds.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
